<h3>Learning Bootstrap 5</h3>
Using Bootstrap 5 feels kind of like learning a new programming language. It keeps the same basic idea of HTML but adds in a bunch of new terminology and ways to write the HTMl that makes it really weird to learn. One thing that I can say I like having Bootstrap 5 for over just HTML and CSS is how there are things already baked into the program which makes creating certain UI designs easier. For example, using navbar to create a navigation bar is made really easy thanks to Bootstrap 5. 

Using Bootstrap 5 and HTML I have recreated the design of a few websites with some basic elements. 


